  "details": "**Steps to reproduce:**\n\n1. Make sure \"see own chatbox\" is enabled\n\n2. Send a chatbox message\n\n3. Move around\n\n4. Pay attention to the way the chatbox moves above your head\n\n**Actual result:**\n\nThe chatbox message lags behind instead of staying directly above your head\n\n**Expected result:**\n\nThe chatbox message remains fixed above your head\n\n**Note:**\n\n- This is way more obvious when moving super quickly and jumping up and down",
